    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "RIO DE JANEIRO\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktailo\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nMenus\nSuco de Fruta\nChilled fruit juice\nFrutas Frescas\nFresh fruit suprême\nTorradas \"Forestière\"\nScrambled eggs and mushrooms on a toasted muffin with Canadian bacon\nOmeleta à Portuguêsa\nA delicious omelet with tomato filling\nPanqueca \"Normande\"\nAn apple filled crêpe with a lush cheese sauce\nSalsichas Defumadas",
      "A delicious omelet with tomato filling\nPanqueca \"Normande\"\nAn apple filled crêpe with a lush cheese sauce\nSalsichas Defumadas\nGrilled breakfast sausages\nBife de Lombo\nBreakfast steak\nCesta de Pães\nBreakfast breads\nCafé\nCoffee\nManteiga e Marmelada\nFresh butter and preserves\nCafé sem Cafeína\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nTea\nSelected French Wines\nFrench Champagne Brut\nDrambuie Amaretto di Saronno Bénédictine\nCrème de Menthe Cognac VSOP\nContreau\n325.KP201",
      "Dong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nRIO DE JANEIRO is the jewel of South America. Nowhere in the world is a city blessed with so much\nnatural beauty. Corcovado Mountain, crowned by the imposing statue of Christ the Redeemer, and\nSugar Loaf, overlooking Guanabara Bay and the city lights below, are equally breathtaking sights\nRio is also renowned for its magnificent beaches. Gavea Beach, the site of the luxurious\nInter-Continental-Rio, and Copacabana Beach, with its mosaic walks, are world famous. Pan Am\nserves Rio daily from New York Washington, Miami, San Francisco, Los Angeles, and Houston\nPAN AM."
    ],
